# Raw run data stays on this Mac (dumps, events, pings, status samples: tens of MB per case).
# Committed: each case's runs/<case>_<stamp>/result.json, runs/SUMMARY.md (run.py table), runs/replay_c4.json,
# and CW10's runs/cam_lipsync/<name>/result.json.
runs/*/*
!runs/*/result.json
!runs/cam_lipsync/*/
runs/cam_lipsync/*/*
!runs/cam_lipsync/*/result.json
